    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Airline Satisfaction\r\n\r\nContinue investigating passenger satisfaction with a second visualization.\r\n\r\n**Data Question:** How do passenger satisfaction counts compare across airline classes?\r\n\r\n1. Run the starter code and review the stacked bar chart.\r\n2. Group the data by `Satisfaction` and use `sum()` to total the values in `Count`.\r\n3. Create a pie chart with satisfaction labels, percentages, and a meaningful title.\r\n4. Use one comparison from each chart to answer the data question. Explain what the pie chart adds to the stacked bar chart.\r\n\r\n:::: details [Need Help?]\r\n\r\nAsk AI Tutor to explain your code, output, or errors. Use its guidance to complete the chart yourself.\r\n\r\n::::",
    "ai_tutor_available": "false",
